<!-- ipp: the tile of the Playlists grid and of the theme gallery (ItemThemeBinding). A FrameLayout,
     not a ConstraintLayout: a tile is measured every time a row scrolls in, and the solver is the
     dearest part of that measure. The caption has no side margin: a start margin is resolved only
     at layout, and the name was measured the tile's full width and then stood off centre. Sizes are set from code (Theme.tileFit). -->
